  "revision": "Rev. 3, December 2021",
  "pages": 9
 },
 "summary": "One-channel optocouplers in a 4-lead mini-flat package on a 1.27 mm lead pitch, each a phototransistor with collector and emitter on their own pins. An FODM217 has one GaAs infrared LED at its input; an FODM214 has two GaAs infrared LEDs in inverse parallel for AC operation. Grades are sorted by current transfer ratio, from 20 % to 600 % across the family, and the isolation is rated 3750 VAC rms for one minute under UL1577. FODM217AR2 is the 80 % to 160 % grade with one LED, on tape and reel of 3000.",
